Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-20.1.8 -> llvmorg-21.1.8):
  - clang/lib/AST/Expr.cpp: dropped hunk (llvm/llvm-project#130272 CallExpr::getBeginLoc assertion fixed upstream in LLVM 21).
  - clang/lib/Basic/Targets/SPIR.cpp: preserved LLVM 21 SmallVector<Builtin::InfosShard> return type on getTargetBuiltins() while keeping AMDGPUTI->.
  - clang/lib/Headers/cpuid.h: context updated for reformatted x86-64 __cpuid_count macro.
  - clang/lib/Sema/SemaDecl.cpp: context updated for NumNamedMembers loop preceding field verification.

Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-21.1.8 -> llvmorg-22.1.8):
  - clang/include/clang/AST/TypeBase.h & Type.h: split QualType::hasUnion() declarations into TypeBase.h following LLVM 22's Type.h split.
  - TargetInfo.{h,cpp} & Targets/{X86.h,AArch64.cpp}: LLVM 22 centralized DataLayout computation into TargetInfo::resetDataLayout() via Triple::computeDataLayout(); injected ni:0 for ELF x86_64/aarch64 directly in TargetInfo::resetDataLayout(), dropping per-target overrides in X86.h and AArch64.cpp.
  - clang/lib/Headers/cpuid.h: context updated for doxygen comments and removed bit_AVX10_512.
  - clang/lib/Basic/Targets/NVPTX.cpp: replaced direct DataLayoutString assignment with resetDataLayout(...) matching TargetInfo's BeforeFilC/AfterFilC split.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-22.1.8 -> llvmorg-23.1.6):
  - TargetInfo.h: context updated for isProcessorName() insertion above getDataLayoutString().
  - ASTContext.cpp -> CompilerInvocation.cpp: Before LLVM 23, Fil-C overrode ASTContext::getVTableContext() to unconditionally construct ItaniumVTableContext(*this, ItaniumVTableContext::Pointer), ignoring LangOpts.RelativeCXXABIVTables so that vtable slots always store full pointers (required by Fil-C's InvisiCap capability model instead of 32-bit relative offsets). LLVM 23 removed ItaniumVTableContext::ComponentLayout and reads LangOpts.RelativeCXXABIVTables directly in AST/CodeGen; forcing Opts.RelativeCXXABIVTables = false in CompilerInvocation.cpp preserves the exact pre-LLVM-23 pointer-vtable behavior.
  - SPIR.cpp: updated AMDGPUTI static-initializer removal for multi-line Triple constructor and new isValidCPUName/fillValidCPUList pointer dereferences.


Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-23.1.6 -> LLVM main 1bd1774757f8):
  - TargetInfo.cpp: context updated around resetDataLayout() (moved below new helpers).
  - NVPTX.cpp: simplified Triple.computeDataLayout() call (NVPTXUseShortPointers removed upstream); kept resetDataLayout() wrapper.

